{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/303394-the-best-arts-what-are-your-favorites-powers-from-ctd","id":303394,"title":"The Best Arts-What Are Your Favorites Powers From CtD?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-05T10:43:33-08:00","id":303394,"title":"The Best Arts-What Are Your Favorites Powers From CtD?","content":"So I started thinking about Dreaming again last night, and this curiosity of a question came to me. It's as simple as it sounds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T12:02:25-08:00","id":303567,"title":"","content":"The Cold based Art and the Time based one I don't recall the names of - I've allways like the idea of time and cold manipulation and both of them always worked well for my Wintery Balor Lord","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar324_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T11:59:05-08:00","id":304831,"title":"","content":"Been too long since I cracked open CtD, so I don't remember the combination, but there was a movement power + Actor (that's the one to effect self, right?) which let someone jump really high.<br /> <br /> I always wanted to use that with two different Kiths. With a Satyr as his favored attack mode, jump and pounce on someone seemed so right for the passion sex maniacs. The other was with a Troll as his main means of transportation just so I could have him land somewhere, shout <span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>&quot;HULK SMASH!&quot;</b></span></span> and tear the place up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T08:12:22-08:00","id":305756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/303394-the-best-arts-what-are-your-favorites-powers-from-ctd?p=304831#post304831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Been too long since I cracked open CtD, so I don't remember the combination, but there was a movement power + Actor (that's the one to effect self, right?) which let someone jump really high.</div> </div> </div> </div>Power is Hopscotch the first power in Wayfare, and the realm to affect yourself is naturally Fae.<br /> <br /> I love Hopscotch as well especially since it is rather versatile power especially with Prop as that allows you to slightly bend some rules and go past Actor Realm as you make your targets clothing hop a few stories, most clothes are sturdy enough not to tear away and will at least take their wearer back for some distance, as well as the ever popular instant missile thing using the same power to cause some random item in the scene to hop against your enemy etc.<br /> <br /> Power wise Sovereign is also rather high on my list as it is just so useful and a really good pick for any Sidhe to have. On the mirror side I also love Discord for similar reasons as I like Sovereign.<br /> <br /> I also like the aforementioned Chronos for my Sidhe but otherwise tend to steer clear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T16:56:59-08:00","id":306240,"title":"","content":"Sovereign always rated high for me, but in anything close to CrossOver play then Naming was a must have. Primal also had a world full of interesting uses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T22:59:03-08:00","id":306432,"title":"","content":"Dreamcraft. If my Sidhe is going to be exiled from Arcadia, you can bet he's going to at least live well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T02:59:01-08:00","id":307285,"title":"","content":"I've found that Changeling powers themselves aren't all that great, compared to what they can do in creative hands. Chicanery 1 can be an amazing tool, and though it can't cause damage, it can definitely be a useful combat are - throw out some Scene and Fae, and suddenly everyone hears that Sovereign-using Sidhe honking like a goose, rather than giving intelligible orders! it doesn't target the Sidhe, so his birthright doesn't cancel it. Pain suddenly feels like light tickles.<br /> <br /> Transforming one sensory input into another, as a level 1 power, and COMPLETELY at the whim of the user? It's a bottomless well, if you can think of ways to use it.<br /> <br /> But in terms of raw, mechanical power? Naming is the most powerful Art, I think. Once had a sorcerer blow away an entire chunk of the landscape with a Holly Strike and a preparation of the 2nd-levle naming power. Those stored successes can do impressive things!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/612-the-cat-came-back","name":"The Cat Came Back","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar612_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T07:59:24-08:00","id":307432,"title":"","content":"Wayfare, seriously I recommend it to everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T01:07:15-08:00","id":313557,"title":"","content":"Was there a cantrip that enhanced strength and combat performance ala stone contract from CtL besides discord?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/530-bloodspeaker","name":"Bloodspeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar530_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T03:24:19-08:00","id":313596,"title":"","content":"Mostly just the Remembrance background and invoking Dragons Ire, Bloodpeaker. Or using Chronos and Wayfare in broken broken ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T